ship are more critical for long-distance, and that the crew cooperation concerns for C (communication difficulty, egocentric) are more serious than A's organization issues. She could maintain vote for A.\n\nThus public message: \"I understand James's points, but I remain convinced A is stronger because ...\". Provide evidence: A anticipates dangerous situations, sees complex connections, very good leadership, while C has communication difficulty and egocentric, not willing to further education. Also note A's unorganized but can be mitigated. So vote A.\n\nProceed."}
